# EclipseOS live-session sudo policy (Phase 1 preview).
#
# The live user has no password, so sudo cannot prompt for one. This file is
# part of the live image only; the Phase 3 installer must not copy the live
# account or this drop-in into an installed system. Installed users must
# authenticate with their own password.
eclipse ALL=(ALL:ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL
